{"c":[{"name":"20261007T094325Z-2ecfd9f27d40a67e","text":"Ask scope is Jev's per-field scope ask (asks/not/unclear, two wordings, SCOPE_CUTOFF); code only vetoes. Answer a widening finding with a veto or 'unclear', never a hand-written reading rule: A2's twelve rounds of those never converged.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261007T094325Z-46934d63d09e671d","text":"Recalibrate SCOPE_CUTOFF after changing the scope ask's wording: scripts/ask-scope-eval.ts scores Jev's answers against scripts/ask-scope-labels.json; --answers rescores a saved run for free.","type":"note"}]}
